sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller
    participant Broker as TurnBroker
    participant Runner as Pipeline runner<br/>(background Task)
    participant Store

    Client->>Controller: GET /messages/stream?message=...
    Controller->>Broker: Start(convId, turnId, lockHandle, runner)
    Broker-)Runner: fire-and-forget Task
    Controller->>Broker: SubscribeAsync(afterEventId=0)
    Broker-->>Controller: SseEnvelope stream

    Runner->>Broker: AppendAsync("init", {turnId, provider, model})
    Broker-->>Controller: id:1 event:init data:{turnId:X}
    Controller-->>Client: id:1 ...init...

    loop per agent event
        Runner->>Broker: AppendAsync("content", {...})
        Broker-->>Controller: id:N event:content
        Controller-->>Client: id:N ...content...
        Note over Client: sessionStorage.activeStream = {convId, turnId:X, lastId:N}
    end

    Note over Client: User reloads tab.<br/>Fetch aborts.<br/>Pipeline keeps running (lock held by Broker).

    Client->>Controller: GET /messages/stream?turnId=X&lastEventId=N
    Controller->>Broker: Find(convId, turnId=X)
    Broker-->>Controller: TurnBuffer (active or retained)
    Controller->>Broker: SubscribeAsync(afterEventId=N)
    Broker-->>Controller: replay events with id > N, then live
    Controller-->>Client: id:N+1 ... id:final event:complete

    Runner->>Store: UpdateAsync(conversation)
    Runner->>Broker: AppendAsync("complete", {...})
    Note over Broker: CompleteAsync(outcome). Lock disposed in finally. Buffer moved to 90s retention.

    alt Explicit cancel
        Client->>Controller: DELETE /active-turn
        Controller->>Broker: Cancel(convId)
        Broker-)Runner: Cancellation.Cancel()
        Runner->>Broker: AppendAsync("error", ...) then rethrow
    end
